
## Tools

```bash
{{.CleaveBin}} --format jsonl <filename> # All traits + rule paths
{{.CleaveBin}} strings <filename>        # Program strings (including XOR encoded)
{{.CleaveBin}} symbols <filename>        # Symbols
{{.CleaveBin}} sections <filename>       # Binary section data
{{.CleaveBin}} metrics <filename>        # Structure metrics
```

These are useful to debug rules:

```
{{.CleaveBin}} test-rules <filename> --rules "rule-id"
{{.CleaveBin}} test-match <filename> --type string --pattern "X"
```

